UPDATE companies SET description='Purelight Power is a residential solar installation company headquartered in Lexington, Kentucky.

The company manages each project through a four-step workflow: an initial consultation to assess energy needs, a design phase using 3D modeling to optimize panel placement, handling of engineering and permitting, and final installation by local crews. After commissioning, customers receive access to web-enabled monitoring to track system performance. Purelight Power reports having completed installations for over 1,000 customers.

Its customer base consists of homeowners seeking to reduce electricity costs and gain energy independence.

Purelight Power emphasizes transparency and simplicity, promoting a no-hidden-fee policy and a low-pressure sales approach. It backs installations with a 25-year performance guarantee, a power production guarantee, and a 10-year workmanship warranty, and states that it uses only industry-rated panels and equipment suited to local climates.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation", "System design and 3D modeling", "Permitting and inspection management", "Post-installation monitoring", "Financing facilitation"], "industries": ["Residential solar installation", "Renewable energy services"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["25-year performance guarantee", "Power production guarantee", "10-year workmanship warranty", "No hidden fees or high-pressure sales", "Local installer network"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Lexington, Kentucky -> /", "Residential solar installation service -> /", "Four-step process: consultation, design, permitting, installation -> /", "Over 1,000 customers served -> /", "25-year performance guarantee, power production guarantee, 10-year workmanship warranty -> /", "Operates in Oregon, Iowa, Montana, Minnesota -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We hire experienced, local installers that specialize in residential solar power to ensure your system is done right the first time.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='purelight-power' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Purposeful Design operates a wood and metal manufacturing facility in Indianapolis, Indiana. Founded as a Christian ministry, the organization welcomes men from homeless missions who are seeking a better life, offering them employment and a structured path toward self-sufficiency. The ministry’s model combines job creation with wrap-around support in discipleship, community, mentorship, housing, and transportation.

The company produces solid wood furniture for commercial and residential markets, including tables, desks, benches, and custom wood tops such as tabletops, countertops, shelving, and stair treads. It also supplies OEM component parts and provides refinishing services. All manufacturing is performed in-house using woodworking and metalworking processes, with an emphasis on industry-standard timing and quality.

Customers include commercial furniture buyers, residential clients, and OEM manufacturers seeking component parts. The product line spans commercial furniture projects, residential goods, and wood-top solutions for interior and architectural applications. Sales of these products generate the revenue that sustains the ministry’s life-rebuilding programs.

