heney Bennett Pedestrian Bridge, William Johnston School, Margaret B. Mack Apartments -> /about", "Leadership team: Glenn Salamone (President), Dave Rusconi (VP Operations), etc. -> /about", "Safety awards from CT Association of Builders and Contractors -> /", "Top 5000 Fastest Growing Companies recognition -> /", "Renovation specialization with in-house forces -> /about", "BIM and CNC-driven fabrication -> /services", "Miscellaneous metals capabilities (canopies, mezzanines, bollards, ladders, stairs, rails) -> /services", "Mission: deliver superior quality products using sustainable procedures certified by AISC -> /", "Vision: best steel structure design solutions, on-time delivery -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "QSR Steel is an exceptional one-stop, full service structural steel company based in Hartford, CT offering everything from steel buildings to stairs and railings.", "founded_year": "2000", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='qsr-steel-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
