UPDATE companies SET description='Qorvo Inc. is a wireless semiconductor company headquartered in Greensboro, North Carolina, founded in 2015. The company employs between 5,000 and 9,999 people and operates U.S.-based manufacturing facilities for its RF solutions and foundry services.

