UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Manufacturing Services Inc. (QMS) operates from a 52,000-square-foot facility in Lake Mary, Florida, within Central Florida''s technology corridor. The company was founded in 1995 and is structured as an employee-owned ESOP corporation.

