UPDATE companies SET description='RBW, an independent design and manufacturing company, was founded in 2007 as RBW Studio LLC and is headquartered in Kingston, New York. The company operates as a certified B Corporation, reflecting a commitment to social and environmental accountability alongside its lighting business.

